docs {
  # Gets metadata of an ActiveGate token

  The token secret is **not** exposed.

  **Auth:** OAuth (inherited from collection)

  **Required OAuth scopes:** `environment-api:activegate-tokens:read`, `fleet-management:activegate.tokens:read`

  **API token scopes:** activeGateTokenManagement.read
}
